WEBVTT

00:03:59.574 --> 00:04:02.899
ni kuthibitisha kuwa ni mtu na sio sehemu ya kinanda

00:04:02.899 --> 00:04:04.461
Mara nyingi katika historia

00:04:04.461 --> 00:04:06.449
Watawala wametumia uoga

00:04:06.449 --> 00:04:10.248
Kunyamazisha ukweli na upinzani

00:04:10.248 --> 00:04:12.287
Ni wakati wa kuanzisha kitu kipya

00:04:12.287 --> 00:04:14.262
Asante Sana

00:04:14.262 --> 00:04:16.116
(Makofi)